          "to": "j'appelle /ʒapɛl/ 'I call'",
          "note": "Schwa of the open syllable alternates with /ɛ/ when the syllable is closed."
        },
        {
          "from": "harceler /aʁsəle/ 'to harass'",
          "to": "il harcèle /il aʁsɛl/ 'he harasses'"
